        "eyebrow": "YOUR REPLACEMENTS",
        "heading": "Keep the system. Refresh the filters.",
        "body": "<p>Use carbon filters? Choose carbon replacements. Refill media is for existing POSTreat owners. Prices are in USD.</p>",
        "anchor_id": "plans",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#153a5b",
        "desktop_padding": 40,
        "mobile_padding": 24,
        "selector_label": "Choose a replacement to see your plan",
        "footnote": "<p>Refill media is only for POSTreat owners. If you use carbon filters alone, you do not need refill media. If you own POSTreat filters, keep the steel housings and replace the media inside.</p>",
        "gift_heading": "Buying a gift?",
        "gift_body": "<p>Choose a one-time purchase unless you intend to pay for ongoing replacements. A filter subscription keeps charging the payment method used at signup.</p>",
        "sold_heading": "Sold or returned your system?",
        "sold_body": "<p>Cancel each filter subscription separately. Selling, gifting or returning a system does not automatically end recurring filter orders.</p>",
        "legal_note": "<p>Berkey®, Purewell® and Waterdrop® are trademarks of their respective owners. Phoenix Gravity is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any of them; compatibility references describe physical fit only.</p>",
        "qa_1": "[CONFIRM FIT + TRADEMARK DISCLAIMER]",
