      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "ILLUSTRATED SUBSCRIPTION GUIDE",
        "heading": "Your replacement routine, explained",
        "body": "<p>See which filters you need, how recurring deliveries work, and how to stay in control of your schedule.</p>",
