        "mobile_padding": 24,
        "video": "shopify://files/videos/03.mp4",
        "external_video": "",
        "poster_alt": "Illustrated guide: Your replacement routine, explained",
        "play_label": "Play Your replacement routine, explained",
        "status": "",
        "transcript": "<p>Read transcript</p><p>1. Start with the filters you use. Carbon filters are the main replacements. FluoRid refill media is for existing POSTreat owners.&nbsp;</p><p>2. Choose your delivery plan. Review the current price and delivery frequency before checkout. One-time purchase is also available.&nbsp;</p><p>3. Know how renewals work. Your first charge is at checkout. Future orders charge your saved payment method on the renewal schedule.&nbsp;</p><p>4. You stay in control. Skip, reschedule, pause or cancel from your account. Review your next charge and keep the confirmation.</p>"
      }
    },
