            "body": "<p>They arrive as a complete pair— AISI 304 stainless steel housings pre-filled with FluoRid media—and drop into your Phoenix Gravity system alongside your carbon elements.</p><p>$99 one-time, or $94 on subscription. The housings are warranted for ten years, so our recommendation is to buy the housings once and subscribe to refills. The steel subscription would send new housings every 4 months.</p>",
