        "interval_explanation": "<p>Need your next refill closer to 6 months? &nbsp;FluoRid media has a 4–6-month replacement window. Some households reach the later end of that window, depending on water use and conditions. Your default subscription delivery is every 4 months. Reschedule the next delivery or choose an available frequency in your account; follow the product's time and capacity limits, whichever comes first. Our team can help you choose a suitable schedule.</p>"
