        "account_video_body": "<p>Sign in with the email used for your order, open your subscription, and change the next delivery date or an available frequency. Save, then check your next charge date.</p>",
        "account_video_status": "",
        "account_video_transcript": "<p>1. Open your Phoenix account. Sign in with the email used for your order. Follow the sign-in steps shown on your account page.&nbsp;</p><p>2. Select your subscription. Open Subscriptions. Choose the filter plan you want to change and review its next scheduled charge.&nbsp;</p><p>3. Change the delivery date. Choose Reschedule, or an available frequency. Pick a date that suits your replacement needs.&nbsp;</p><p>4. Save. Then check the date. Save your changes and confirm the updated next charge date. Update each active subscription separately.</p>",
        "promises": "<ul><li>No minimum term or cancellation fee</li><li>Skip one delivery or pause for a while</li><li>Cancel online &nbsp;- no phone call required</li></ul>",
