    "ss_faq": {
      "type": "subscribe-save-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_category_1": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Basics",
            "anchor_id": "faq-the-basics"
          }
        },
        "faq_1_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-what-is-subscribe-save",
            "question": "What is Subscribe & Save?",
            "answer": "<p>A recurring purchase of replacement filters. Your first order is charged at checkout, then your saved payment method is automatically charged at each renewal. Carbon is every 12 months; fluoride plans are every 4 months. It is separate from signing up for Phoenix newsletters and offers.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_1_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-is-there-a-fee-or-a-minimum-number-of-orders",
            "question": "Is there a fee, or a minimum number of orders?",
            "answer": "<p>No to both. There is no signup fee, no membership cost, no minimum term and no cancellation fee. You can cancel after your first delivery if you want to.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_1_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-is-the-discount-only-on-renewals-or-on-my-first-order-too",
            "question": "Is the discount only on renewals, or on my first order too?",
            "answer": "<p>Your first order too. Subscriber pricing applies from order one and is not an introductory discount. Carbon is currently $119 every 12 months. Any future price change requires advance notice; see Billing &amp; Delivery.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_1_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-which-products-can-i-subscribe-to",
            "question": "Which products can I subscribe to?",
            "answer": "<p>You can subscribe to Carbon Filter Elements (every 12 months) and FluoRid Refill Media (every 4 months). Refill media is only for customers who already own POSTreat filters; carbon-only customers do not need it. Adding POSTreat is optional. If you choose to add fluoride filtration, buy steel elements first, then consider refills. The steel subscription sends new housings and media every 4 months. Systems, stands, spigots and spare parts are one-time purchases.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_1_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-does-joining-or-leaving-the-email-list-change-my-subscription",
            "question": "Does joining or leaving the email list change my subscription?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Phoenix email updates are newsletters and offers only. Subscribe & Save is a recurring product purchase. Unsubscribing from marketing emails does not cancel scheduled filter orders or their charges. Manage those in Account Subscriptions.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_category_2": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Choosing A Plan",
            "anchor_id": "faq-choosing-a-plan"
          }
        },
        "faq_2_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-i-already-own-postreat-steel-elements-which-plan-do-i-need",
            "question": "I already own POSTreat steel elements. Which plan do I need?",
            "answer": "<p>The FluoRid Refill Media plan at $59 every 4 months. Your stainless housings are warranted for ten years; only the media inside is used up. Refilling costs $105 a year less than buying new steel elements.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-can-i-subscribe-to-more-than-one-filter",
            "question": "Can I subscribe to more than one filter?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, if you use both carbon and POSTreat filters. Carbon runs on a 12-month cycle; refill media for existing POSTreat filters runs on a 4-month cycle. If you have not opted for POSTreat, you do not need refill media. Each subscription has its own schedule and can be managed separately.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-can-i-switch-plans-later",
            "question": "Can I switch plans later?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Cancel the one you no longer want and start the other from its product page. If you would rather we handle it, email hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com and we will switch it for you without a gap in your deliveries.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_2_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-do-the-carbon-elements-fit-my-berkey-housing",
            "question": "Do the carbon elements fit my Berkey® housing?",
            "answer": "<p>These plans are intended for Phoenix Gravity systems. Compatibility with other housings requires physical-fit verification before we can promise a fit. Please send us your brand and model before ordering.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "[CONFIRM FIT + TRADEMARK DISCLAIMER]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_category_3": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Deliveries And Timing",
            "anchor_id": "faq-deliveries-and-timing"
          }
        },
        "faq_3_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-when-does-my-first-order-ship",
            "question": "When does my first order ship?",
            "answer": "<p>Your first order is charged at checkout and processed on the usual warehouse schedule, at the subscriber price. Dispatch/transit timing is still being confirmed 2–5 business days. Review the next charge date shown before paying; do not infer it from the delivery date.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "2–5 business days",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-will-you-tell-me-before-you-charge-me",
            "question": "Will you tell me before you charge me?",
            "answer": "<p>The planned renewal email shows the date, amount and items, plus links to manage the subscription. The exact reminder setting must be confirmed: We email you at least 3 days<br/>before every renewal. Keep your subscription email address current and check your next renewal in your account.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "[3 DAYS]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-can-i-get-a-delivery-earlier-or-push-one-back",
            "question": "Can I get a delivery earlier, or push one back?",
            "answer": "<p>Both. Open Account Subscriptions and either ship now or pick a new date. Changes must be made at least 24 hours before a renewal. After that, the order is already being packed.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "[24 HOURS]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-my-household-uses-less-water-can-i-stretch-the-interval",
            "question": "My household uses less water. Can I stretch the interval?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Some households replace FluoRid media closer to 6 months, depending on water use and conditions. The refill plan defaults to every 4 months. Reschedule the next delivery or choose an available frequency in your account. Stay within the rated 6-month life or 1,060 gallons per pair, whichever comes first. Carbon remains 12 months or 5,500 gallons per pair. Ask our team if you are unsure which schedule suits your setup.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_3_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-what-if-i-m-away-when-a-delivery-is-due",
            "question": "What if I'm away when a delivery is due?",
            "answer": "<p>Skip it, move the date, or pause the whole subscription all three take effect immediately and none of them cost anything. Pausing is the right one if you are away for a while and do not know when you will be back.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_category_4": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Price And Payment",
            "anchor_id": "faq-price-and-payment"
          }
        },
        "faq_4_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-how-much-do-i-actually-save",
            "question": "How much do I actually save?",
            "answer": "<p>$10 a delivery on carbon elements, $10 on FluoRid refill media, $5 on POSTreat steel elements. For households with carbon + POSTreat refills, the saving is $40 a year, plus free shipping on all four orders (a $69 refill would not otherwise qualify).</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-do-subscription-orders-always-ship-free",
            "question": "Do subscription orders always ship free?",
            "answer": "<p>Shipping Across 49 U.S. States. Enjoy free shipping within the contiguous U.S., excluding California. We also ship to Alaska and Hawaii; free shipping does not apply to these destinations. Please note: We do not ship to California.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-what-happens-if-my-card-is-declined",
            "question": "What happens if my card is declined?",
            "answer": "<p>We retry and email you each time with a link to update your card. Nothing is canceled silently if we cannot collect payment we tell you before the subscription stops.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "[3 TIMES OVER 7 DAYS]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_4_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-can-the-price-change",
            "question": "Can the price change?",
            "answer": "<p>It can, but not without warning. We email you at least %%QA1%% before any change to your subscription price, and you can skip, change or cancel before it applies.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "[30 DAYS]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_category_5": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Changing And Canceling",
            "anchor_id": "faq-changing-and-canceling"
          }
        },
        "faq_5_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-how-do-i-cancel",
            "question": "How do I cancel?",
            "answer": "<p>Open Account Subscriptions, select the subscription, and choose Cancel. Complete the cancellation, look for a Canceled status, and keep the confirmation. Repeat for any other active subscriptions you want to end. Unsubscribing from newsletters is separate. No phone call is required, and there is no cancellation fee. An order that has already been created may still be processed; contact support about that order.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-is-there-a-cancellation-fee-do-i-lose-anything",
            "question": "Is there a cancellation fee? Do I lose anything?",
            "answer": "<p>No fee, and nothing to return. Any order already placed still ships and is still yours. What you give up is the subscriber price go back to one-time purchases and you pay the standard price again.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-if-i-cancel-and-come-back-later-do-i-get-the-subscriber-price-again",
            "question": "If I cancel and come back later, do I get the subscriber price again?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Resubscribing puts you back on whatever the current subscriber price is. There is no penalty for having left and no waiting period.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-can-i-return-a-subscription-order",
            "question": "Can I return a subscription order?",
            "answer": "<p>Subscription orders are covered by our standard Return Policy, the same as any other order. %%QA1%% Return shipping to our US warehouse is the customer&#x27;s cost.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "[CONFIRM: whether the 100-day money-back guarantee applies to subscription orders, and whether it applies to every order or only the first. Do not publish this answer until that is settled.]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-i-thought-i-canceled-why-is-another-order-scheduled",
            "question": "I thought I canceled. Why is another order scheduled?",
            "answer": "<p>Leaving an email list does not cancel any subscription, and canceling one subscription does not cancel the others. Look for Canceled and keep the confirmation. If an order still appears, contact hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com with your order details; do not email card information.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-how-do-i-change-my-shipping-address-or-payment-method",
            "question": "How do I change my shipping address or payment method?",
            "answer": "<p>Open the specific subscription, then Address or Payment. Check each active subscription separately; an address in your main account or a one-time checkout may not update the subscription. Make changes before the renewal cutoff 24 Hours, review the saved details, and use the secure payment update flow.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "24 Hours",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-can-i-buy-a-subscription-as-a-gift",
            "question": "Can I buy a subscription as a gift?",
            "answer": "<p>Choose a one-time purchase if you only intend to pay for one order. A subscription gift continues to charge the payment method used at signup. Giving the system to someone else does not transfer the subscription or change the saved payer. Contact support before arranging ongoing deliveries for another person.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-what-if-i-sold-gifted-or-returned-my-system",
            "question": "What if I sold, gifted or returned my system?",
            "answer": "<p>Cancel each active filter subscription separately and confirm its Canceled status. Selling, gifting or returning the system does not automatically cancel recurring replacements. Cancellation stops future renewals; contact support separately about any order already created.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "faq_5_9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "faq-do-i-need-new-steel-housings-every-time-i-replace-fluoride-media",
            "question": "Do I need new steel housings every time I replace fluoride media?",
            "answer": "<p>No. Refill media is only for customers who already own compatible POSTreat filters with usable steel housings. If you have not opted for POSTreat, you do not need refill media. If you decide to add optional fluoride filtration, buy steel elements with media first. Follow the supplied refill instructions; contact support if any step is unclear.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        }
