    "ss_terms": {
      "type": "subscribe-save-terms",
      "blocks": {
        "term_1": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-1",
            "number": "01",
            "title": "What these terms cover",
            "body": "<p>They govern the Phoenix Gravity Subscribe &amp; Save program on phoenixwaterfilters.com for customers in the United States. Enrolling in a plan means you accept them.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_2": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-2",
            "number": "02",
            "title": "Eligibility and account",
            "body": "<p>You must be 18 or over, have a valid payment method and a US shipping address. A Phoenix account is created for you at checkout so you can manage the subscription yourself.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_3": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-3",
            "number": "03",
            "title": "Enrolling",
            "body": "<p>Select Subscribe &amp; Save instead of One-time purchase on an eligible product page and complete checkout. Before you pay we show you the subscriber price, the delivery interval and the date of your next charge. Completing checkout is your authorization for recurring charges on that schedule. Newsletter opt-in is separate and is not authorization for recurring product charges. Review the recurring amount and frequency and actively agree to the subscription before paying.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_4": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-4",
            "number": "04",
            "title": "Subscriber pricing",
            "body": "<p>The subscriber price applies to your first order and to every renewal for as long as the subscription is active. It is not an introductory rate and does not step up. Current prices: Carbon Filter Elements $119 every 12 months; POSTreat FluoRid Refill Media $59 every 4 months; POSTreat Steel Elements $94 every 4 months. Prices exclude sales tax.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_5": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-5",
            "number": "05",
            "title": "Billing and authorization",
            "body": "<p>Your first order is charged at checkout. Each renewal is then charged automatically to your stored payment method on the renewal date, until you cancel. Payment details are stored by Shopify; Phoenix does not hold your card number. Gift orders use the payment method supplied at enrollment unless updated. Giving away, selling or returning a system does not cancel its separate filter subscriptions.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_6": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-6",
            "number": "06",
            "title": "Renewal notices",
            "body": "<p>We email you at least %%QA1%% before each renewal, stating the date, the amount and the items, with links to skip, change or cancel.</p>",
            "qa_1": "[3 DAYS]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_7": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-7",
            "number": "07",
            "title": "Shipping",
            "body": "<p>Shipping Across 49 U.S. States Enjoy free shipping within the contiguous U.S., excluding California. We also ship to Alaska and Hawaii; free shipping does not apply to these destinations. Please note: We do not ship to California.</p>",
            "qa_1": "[2â€“5 BUSINESS DAYS]",
            "qa_2": "[CONFIRM SHIPPING TERRITORY]",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_8": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-8",
            "number": "08",
            "title": "Changes and the cutoff",
            "body": "<p>You may change the delivery date, frequency, items, shipping address or payment method at any time from your account. Changes must be made at least before a scheduled renewal; after that, the order is in processing and the change applies from the following delivery.</p>",
            "qa_1": "24 Hours",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_9": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-9",
            "number": "09",
            "title": "Skipping and pausing",
            "body": "<p>You may skip any individual delivery or pause the subscription indefinitely from your account. Skipping and pausing are free, take effect immediately, and do not affect your subscriber price when deliveries resume.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_10": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-10",
            "number": "10",
            "title": "Cancellation",
            "body": "<p>You may cancel at any time from Account â†’ Subscriptions, from the manage link in any subscription email, or by contacting us. Cancellation is immediate and free; there is no minimum term and no cancellation fee. Orders already placed before you cancel will still be fulfilled and charged. Canceling ends your subscriber pricing future one-time purchases are at the standard price. Check for Canceled status and keep the confirmation. Cancel every active subscription you want to end; unsubscribing from marketing emails does not cancel product subscriptions.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_11": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-11",
            "number": "11",
            "title": "Failed payments",
            "body": "<p>If a renewal payment fails We retry 3 times over 7 days and email you each time. If payment still cannot be collected we may pause or cancel the subscription, and we will tell you when we do. We will never cancel a subscription for non-payment without notifying you.</p>",
            "qa_1": "",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_12": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-12",
            "number": "12",
            "title": "Price changes",
            "body": "<p>We may change subscription prices. If we do, we will email you at least 30Days before the new price applies to your subscription, so that you can skip, change or cancel beforehand. Continuing after that notice period means you accept the new price.</p>",
            "qa_1": "[30 DAYS]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_13": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-13",
            "number": "13",
            "title": "Returns, refunds and the guarantee",
            "body": "<p>Subscription orders are covered by our standard Return Policy. Return shipping to our US warehouse is at the customer's cost. %%QA1%%</p>",
            "qa_1": "[CONFIRM AND INSERT: whether the 100-day money-back guarantee applies to subscription orders; whether it applies to every order or the first only; and the condition of goods required for a refund.]",
            "qa_2": "",
            "qa_3": ""
          }
        },
        "term_14": {
          "type": "term",
          "settings": {
            "anchor_id": "terms-14",
            "number": "14",
            "title": "Availability, changes to the program and these terms",
            "body": "<p>Plans are offered subject to availability, and we may add, change or withdraw a plan. If we withdraw a plan you are enrolled in, we will notify you and no further charges will be made. We may update these terms; material changes will be notified by email at least 30 Days in advance and the \"last updated\" date above will change. These terms are governed by the laws of the States.</p>",
